  "description": "StrongOf helps to implement primitives as a strong type that represents a domain object (e.g. UserId, EmailAddress, etc.). It is a simple class that wraps a value and provides a few helper methods to make it easier to work with.\n      In contrast to other approaches, StrongOf is above all simple and performant - and not over-engineered.",
